From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brian Jenkins <brianjenkins94@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 00:29:33 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: avoid runtime dependencies from core on chat and
 notebook implementations

Search, terminal decorations, SCM, tasks, getting started and the extension
host only needed a type, a lazily-used class, a command/tool id or a small
helper from chat/notebook, but imported them from modules that load the whole
chat implementation or notebook editor, which made them part of every
workbench, even without the chat/notebook service overrides.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
